## 6. Model Selection Decision

### Selected Model: **Logistic Regression**

### Rationale:

| Criteria | Why Logistic Regression Wins |
|----------|------------------------------|
| **Performance** | Higher across ALL 5 metrics |
| **Interpretability** | Coefficients show direct feature impact |
| **Efficiency** | Trains in seconds vs minutes |
| **Stability** | Cross-validation shows consistent performance |
| **Simplicity** | No hyperparameter tuning needed |

### Key Insight:
Logistic Regression correctly identifies 207 out of 373 churn cases (55% recall) while maintaining 81% overall accuracy. For business use, this means catching over half of potential churners with minimal false alarms.

