## 7. Feature Importance Analysis

### Top 5 Predictors of Churn (from Random Forest):

| Rank | Feature | Importance | Business Meaning |
|------|---------|------------|------------------|
| 1 | **Tenure** | 0.23 | New customers churn more |
| 2 | **MonthlyCharges** | 0.15 | Higher bills = higher risk |
| 3 | **ContractType** | 0.12 | Month-to-month riskiest |
| 4 | **TotalCharges** | 0.10 | Lower total = newer = higher risk |
| 5 | **InternetService** | 0.08 | Fiber optic users churn more |

### Business Interpretation:
- **Tenure is strongest predictor** - Customers with less than 12 months tenure are most likely to churn
- **Month-to-month contracts** have 3x higher churn risk than 2-year contracts
- **High monthly charges (>$70)** significantly increase churn probability

